Recent genetic reséarch indicates that present day Persians are related not to cats from the &lt;a href="Near%20East"&gt;Near East&lt;/a&gt; but to cats from Western Europe. The reséarchers stated, "Even though the early Persian cat may have in fact originated from ancient Persia, the modern Persian cat has lost its &lt;a href="Phylogeography"&gt;phylogeographical&lt;/a&gt; signature."
