<doc id="54363" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=54363" title="SpeedCast">
SpeedCast

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
SpeedCast nyaéta pausahaan panyadia &lt;a href="raramat"&gt;raramat&lt;/a&gt; sadunya sarta layanan &lt;a href="Satelit%20Komunikasi"&gt;satelit komunikasi&lt;/a&gt; nu nawarkeun layanan jasa raramat kualitas panghadéna leuwih ti 90 nagara; sarta raramat &lt;a href="maritim"&gt;maritim&lt;/a&gt; nu ngalayanan konsumén di sakuliah dunya. Kalayan 40 kantor &lt;a href="sales"&gt;sales&lt;/a&gt; pangrojong di sakuliah dunya sarta 39 &lt;a href="t%C3%A9l%C3%A9port"&gt;téléport&lt;/a&gt;, SpeedCast mibanda &lt;a href="infrastruktur"&gt;infrastruktur&lt;/a&gt; unik nu ngawula konsumén global. Kalayan leuwih ti 2.200 palanggan ngaliwatan leuwih ti 4.000 situs &lt;a href="t%C3%A9r%C3%A9strial"&gt;téréstrial&lt;/a&gt; sarta sakitar 5.000 &lt;a href="Jackup%20Rig"&gt;rig&lt;/a&gt; jeung kapal cai di sagara. Udagan SpeedCast dina solusi nu disaluyukeun pikeun lima ségmén palanggan utama: &lt;a href="Telekomunikasi"&gt;télékomunikasi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="maritim"&gt;maritim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%89nergi"&gt;énérgi&lt;/a&gt; &amp; sumber daya alam, &lt;a href="pamar%C3%A9ntah"&gt;pamaréntah&lt;/a&gt; &amp; LSM, sarta &lt;a href="Pausahaan%20Jasa"&gt;pausahaan&lt;/a&gt;. 
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
SpeedCast diadegkeun dina taun &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="AsiaSat"&gt;AsiaSat&lt;/a&gt; jadi nu nyekel saham utama di SpeedCast dina bulan &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;. Dina bulan &lt;a href="Nop%C3%A9mber"&gt;Nopémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, AsiaSat meuli sakabéh saham jadi 100% mibanda SpeedCast. SpeedCast ngalayanan jasa &lt;a href="Satelit%20Komunikasi"&gt;satelit komunikasi&lt;/a&gt; pikeun konsumén leuwih ti 13 taun kaliwat. 
Asosiasi TA, hiji pausahaan ékuitas swasta global nu kasohor, meuli SpeedCast ti &lt;a href="AsiaSat"&gt;AsiaSat&lt;/a&gt; dina bulan &lt;a href="S%C3%A9pt%C3%A9mber"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2012"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt;.
Ti mangsa harita, SpeedCast geus meuli tilu pausahaan &lt;a href="Satelit%20Komunikasi"&gt;satelit komunikasi&lt;/a&gt;: Australian Satellite Communications ("ASC") puseurna di Australia Kidul dina bulan &lt;a href="D%C3%A9s%C3%A9mber"&gt;Désémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2012"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt;;&lt;a href="http%3A//www.businesswire.com/news/home/20121205006387/en/TA-Associates-Partners-SpeedCast-Complete-Buyout-Australian"&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Elektrikom Satellite Service ("Elektrikom") puseurna di &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt; dina bulan &lt;a href="Januari"&gt;Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2013"&gt;2013&lt;/a&gt;;&lt;a href="http%3A//vsat.nl/speedcast/"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;[] sarta Pactel International ("Pactel") puseurna di &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; dina bulan April &lt;a href="2013"&gt;2013&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;a href="https%3A//www.ta.com/about/news/ta-associates-continues-asia-pacific-satellite-consolidation-strategy-partnering-with-portfolio-company-speedcast-in-buyout-of-pactel-international"&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
Dina &lt;a href="Bulan%20%28wayah%29"&gt;bulan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juni"&gt;Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2014"&gt;2014&lt;/a&gt;, SpeedCast ngabéwarakeun akuisisi &lt;a href="Oceanic%20Broadband"&gt;Oceanic Broadband&lt;/a&gt; minangka panyadia integrator sarta solusi &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;.
Dina &lt;a href="Bulan%20%28wayah%29"&gt;bulan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Agustus"&gt;Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2014"&gt;2014&lt;/a&gt;, SpeedCast kadaptar di &lt;a href="Bursa%20%C3%89f%C3%A9k%20Australia"&gt;Bursa Éfék Australia&lt;/a&gt; (ASX: SDA).&lt;a href="http%3A//www.asx.com.au/asx/statistics/announcements.do%3Fby%3DasxCode%26amp%3BasxCode%3DSDA%26amp%3Btimeframe%3DY%26amp%3Byear%3D2014"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, 
Dina &lt;a href="Bulan%20%28wayah%29"&gt;bulan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;, SpeedCast meuli pausahaan &lt;a href="Hermes%20Datacomms"&gt;Hermes Datacomms&lt;/a&gt; panyadia layanan raramat global kasohor pikeun widang industri migas.
Dina &lt;a href="Bulan%20%28wayah%29"&gt;bulan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="M%C3%A9i"&gt;Méi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;, SpeedCast meuli pausahaan &lt;a href="Geolink%20Satellite%20Services"&gt;Geolink Satellite Services&lt;/a&gt; diharepkeun pikeun ngaronjatkeun pausahaan di &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt;, kalayan Geolink aktif leuwih ti 20 negara. 
Dina &lt;a href="Bulan%20%28wayah%29"&gt;bulan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;, SpeedCast meuli pausahaan &lt;a href="NewSat%20%26amp%3B%20SAIT%20Communication"&gt;NewSat &amp; SAIT Communication&lt;/a&gt; panyadia layanan &lt;a href="komunikasi"&gt;komunikasi&lt;/a&gt; maritim nu mekar pesat di Éropa kidul.
Dina &lt;a href="Bulan%20%28wayah%29"&gt;bulan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Nop%C3%A9mber"&gt;Nopémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;, SpeedCast meuli pausahaan &lt;a href="ST%20Teleport"&gt;ST Teleport&lt;/a&gt; panyadia layanan &lt;a href="komunikasi"&gt;komunikasi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Satelit%20Komunikasi"&gt;satelit&lt;/a&gt; kasohor di &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;.
