<h2>Sajarah</h2>
<h3>1990an</h3>
Sajarah.
1990an.
Dina taun 1992, Honda mekarkeun mesin "Big Bang", kalayan henteu konvénsional sarta has. &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Mick Doohan&lt;/a&gt; mintonkeun kaparigelan nu luar biasa kalayan &lt;a href="Honda"&gt;Honda&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="NSR500"&gt;NSR500&lt;/a&gt; anyar nepikeun ka tatu parna dina usum balap harita. Vérsi pangayarna motor ieu pohara nyugemakeun nepikeun ka mampuh mapakan di kelas utama. Éta mangrupa kaajaiban téknologi nu ninggalkeun kesan abadi di dunya balap. &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Doohan&lt;/a&gt; ngahontal gelar juara dunya 500cc kalayan &lt;a href="Honda"&gt;Honda&lt;/a&gt; lima kali noron ti taun 1994. Usum balap taun 1997 mangrupa taun pangalusna pikeun modél ieu, kalayan 15 kameunangan, sababaraha di antarana ngahontal 22 kameunangan noron. &lt;a href="NSR500"&gt;NSR500&lt;/a&gt; jadi sajarah minangka motor legendaris taun 1990-an.
Dina taun 1995 tim nurunkeun 3 purah balap nyaéta &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Mick Doohan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alex%20Criville"&gt;Alex Criville&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Shinichi%20Ito"&gt;Shinichi Ito&lt;/a&gt; maké &lt;a href="Honda%20NSR500"&gt;Honda NSR500&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Doohan&lt;/a&gt; ngahontal Kajuaraan Dunya pikeun kadua kalina sakaligus di &lt;a href="1995%20Argentine%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alex%20Criville"&gt;Criville&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di posisi kaopat kalayan sakali meunang balapan sedengkeun &lt;a href="Shinichi%20Ito"&gt;Ito&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di posisi kalima. Tim dimekarkeun jadi opat urang dina taun 1996; &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Doohan&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Alex%20Criville"&gt;Criville&lt;/a&gt; maké &lt;a href="Honda%20NSR500"&gt;Honda NSR500&lt;/a&gt; sedengkeun &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Tadayuki Okada&lt;/a&gt; jeung Ito maké &lt;a href="Honda%20NSR500V"&gt;Honda NSR500V&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Doohan&lt;/a&gt; ngahontal Kajuaraan Dunya katilu kalayan dalapan kali meunang lomba sarta &lt;a href="Alex%20Criville"&gt;Criville&lt;/a&gt; di posisi runner-up. &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di posisi katujuh sarta Ito di posisi kaduabelas.
Kaopat purah balap diteruskeun taun 1997 nyaéta &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Doohan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alex%20Crivill%C3%A9"&gt;Crivillé&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; maké NSR500 sarta &lt;a href="Takuma%20Aoki"&gt;Takuma Aoki&lt;/a&gt; maké NSR500V. Repsol Honda meunang sakabéh 15 balapan usum ieu kalayan &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Doohan&lt;/a&gt; meunang 12 balapan, sarta meupeuskeun rékor &lt;a href="Giacomo%20Agostini"&gt;Giacomo Agostini&lt;/a&gt; pikeun ngahontal kameunangan dina hiji usum, dina Kajuaraan Dunya kaopatna. &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; jadi runner-up, &lt;a href="Alex%20Crivill%C3%A9"&gt;Crivillé&lt;/a&gt; di posisi kaopat kalayan dua kameunangan tapi teu milu lima balapan sanggeus ngalaman kacilakaan parna di &lt;a href="1997%20Dutch%20TT"&gt;Assen&lt;/a&gt; sedengkeun &lt;a href="Takuma%20Aoki"&gt;Aoki&lt;/a&gt; di posisi kalima. Purah balap Repsol Honda meunang sakabéh posisi podium di opat balapan, di &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="J%C3%A9rman"&gt;Jérman&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;.
Pikeun taun &lt;a href="1998%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Doohan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alex%20Crivill%C3%A9"&gt;Crivillé&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; neruskeun di tim Repsol Honda kalayan motor &lt;a href="Honda%20NSR500"&gt;NSR500&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Sete%20Gibernau"&gt;Sete Gibernau&lt;/a&gt; ngagabung jeung maranéhna maké motor &lt;a href="Honda%20NSR500V"&gt;NSR500V&lt;/a&gt;. Doohan terus mingpin kajuaraan kalayan dalapan kameunangan sarta dileler Juara Dunya pikeun kalima kalina di &lt;a href="1998%20Australian%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Alex%20Crivill%C3%A9"&gt;Crivillé&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di posisi katilu kalayan dua kameunangan, sedengkeun &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; kudu absén tilu balapan sabab pigeulang leungeunna potong nalika latihan di &lt;a href="1998%20Italian%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Itali&lt;/a&gt; sarta anggeus di posisi ka dalapan. &lt;a href="Sete%20Gibernau"&gt;Gibernau&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di posisi kasabelas.
Réngréngan tim tetep sarua pikeun taun &lt;a href="1999%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;, nyaéta &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Doohan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alex%20Crivill%C3%A9"&gt;Crivillé&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Sete%20Gibernau"&gt;Gibernau&lt;/a&gt;. Mangsa kualifikasi di &lt;a href="1999%20Spanish%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Doohan&lt;/a&gt; kungsi kacilakaan parna sarta pamustunganana ngabalukarkeun pangsiun ti olahraga balap. &lt;a href="Alex%20Crivill%C3%A9"&gt;Crivillé&lt;/a&gt; neruskeun genep balapan sarta pikeun ngahontal Kéajuaraan Dunya di &lt;a href="1999%20Rio%20de%20Janeiro%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Rio de Janeiro&lt;/a&gt; kalayan sésa sakali balapan deui di usum ieu. &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di posisi katilu kalayan tilu kali balapan. &lt;a href="Sete%20Gibernau"&gt;Gibernau&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;– nu dimimiti usum maké &lt;a href="Honda%20NSR500V"&gt;NSR500V&lt;/a&gt; saancan ngaganti Doohan maké &lt;a href="Honda%20NSR500"&gt;NSR500&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;– anggeus di posisi kalima. Tim purah balap ieu meunang balap di sakabéh podium di &lt;a href="1999%20Catalan%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Katalunya&lt;/a&gt; kalayan &lt;a href="Alex%20Crivill%C3%A9"&gt;Crivillé&lt;/a&gt; kahiji, &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; kadua sarta &lt;a href="Sete%20Gibernau"&gt;Gibernau&lt;/a&gt; katilu.
<h3>2000an</h3>
2000an.
&lt;a href="Alex%20Crivill%C3%A9"&gt;Crivillé&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Sete%20Gibernau"&gt;Gibernau&lt;/a&gt; angger babarengan satim dina taun &lt;a href="2000%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt; maké motor &lt;a href="Honda%20NSR500"&gt;Honda NSR500&lt;/a&gt;. Usum taun &lt;a href="2000%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt; nyaéta taun nu werit pikeun Tim Repsol Honda, &lt;a href="Alex%20Criville"&gt;Criville&lt;/a&gt; ngan meunang sakali sarta anggeus di posisi kasalapan, &lt;a href="Tadayuki%20Okada"&gt;Okada&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di posisi kasabelas sarta &lt;a href="Sete%20Gibernau"&gt;Gibernau&lt;/a&gt; posisi kalimabelas. Taun &lt;a href="2001%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alex%20Criville"&gt;Criville&lt;/a&gt; digabungkeun jeung &lt;a href="Tohru%20Ukawa"&gt;Tohru Ukawa&lt;/a&gt;. Usum ieu teu jauh leuwih alus batan taun &lt;a href="2000%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Alex%20Crivill%C3%A9"&gt;Crivillé&lt;/a&gt; ngan bisa meunang dua podium jeung nganggeuskeun usum dina posisi kadalapan, sedengkeun &lt;a href="Tohru%20Ukawa"&gt;Ukawa&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di posisi kasapuluh kalayan ngan hiji podium.
Usum taun 2001 dimimitian kalayan babak bubuka nu luar biasa di Suzuka, di mana &lt;a href="Masao%20Azuma"&gt;Masao Azuma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daijiro%20Kato"&gt;Daijiro Kato&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Valentino%20Rossi"&gt;Valentino Rossi&lt;/a&gt; maranéhna meunang kelas 125, 250 dan 500cc, nu ngalantarankeun &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;Honda&lt;/a&gt; ngahontal kameunangan ke-500 di &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Kajuaraan Dunya Balap motor Grand Prix&lt;/a&gt;. Pikeun taun 2002, Honda nurunkeun &lt;a href="Honda%20RC211V"&gt;Honda RC211V&lt;/a&gt; kapasitas 990cc, opat léngkah, ngagunakeun RC ngingetkeun deui kenangan taun-taun emas &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;Honda&lt;/a&gt; di seri &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;GP Dunya&lt;/a&gt; dina taun 1960an. Satiap produsén geus ngaronjatkeun mesinna pikeun tarung panungtung di taun panungtungan balap &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt; 990cc, kalayan &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;Honda&lt;/a&gt; nurunkeun dua vérsi &lt;a href="Honda%20RC211V"&gt;RC211V&lt;/a&gt;.
Dina taun &lt;a href="2002%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;, taun munggaran kelas &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt; anyar, &lt;a href="Valentino%20Rossi"&gt;Valentino Rossi&lt;/a&gt; ngagabung tim bareng jeung &lt;a href="Tohru%20Ukawa"&gt;Ukawa&lt;/a&gt; numpak &lt;a href="Honda%20RC211V"&gt;Honda RC211V&lt;/a&gt; anyar, ngan ukur dua purah balap nu maké motor anyar nepi ka ampir ahir usum, antukna &lt;a href="Alex%20Barros"&gt;Alex Barros&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Daijiro%20Kato"&gt;Daijiro Kato&lt;/a&gt; dibéré ogé &lt;a href="Honda%20RC211V"&gt;Honda RC211V&lt;/a&gt;. Rossi mingpin usum balap ieu kalayan sabelas kameunangan balapan jadi Juara Dunya kalayan sésa balapan opat deui pikeun ahir usum. Taun 2002 &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Nicky Hayden&lt;/a&gt; juara &lt;a href="AMA%20Superbike%20Championship%23AMA%20Superbike%20Champions"&gt;AMA Superbike&lt;/a&gt; ngagabung jeung Rossi taun &lt;a href="2003%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Valentino%20Rossi"&gt;Rossi&lt;/a&gt; kalayan salapan kameunangan sarta meunang podium di sakabéh balapan, jadi Juara Dunya nu katilu kalina noron kalayan sésa dua balapan deu di usum ieu. &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt; anggeus kalima kalayan dua kali naék podium.
Sanggeus kaluarna &lt;a href="Valentino%20Rossi"&gt;Rossi&lt;/a&gt;, veteran &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing"&gt;Grand Prix&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Alex%20Barros"&gt;Alex Barros&lt;/a&gt; ngagabung jeung &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2004%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;. Barros nganggeuskeun usum di posisi kaopat sarta Hayden kalima. Purah balap duanana naék podium tapi teu kungsi meunang balapan kahiji. Taun &lt;a href="2005%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Max%20Biaggi"&gt;Max Biaggi&lt;/a&gt; ngagabung jeung Hayden ka tim Repsol Honda. Hayden ngahontal kameunangan &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt; munggaranna di &lt;a href="2005%20United%20States%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Amérika&lt;/a&gt;, manéhna juara katilu. &lt;a href="Max%20Biaggi"&gt;Biaggi&lt;/a&gt; juara kalima kalayan lima podium.
Usum taun 2006 ieu kasohor lantaran aya sababaraha purah balap ngora dina taun nu pinuh tangtangan. Taun &lt;a href="2006%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt; ngagabung jeung &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Dani Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="List%20of%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20World%20champions"&gt;Juara Dunya 250cc&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt; mingpin kajuaraan pikeun sebagéan badag usum ieu tapi di &lt;a href="2006%20Portuguese%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Portugis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; kacilakaan nabrak &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt;. Purah balap duanana kaluar balapan sarta &lt;a href="Valentino%20Rossi"&gt;Rossi&lt;/a&gt; mingpin kajuaraan kalayan sésa balapan sakali deui. Dina usum balap panungtungan, &lt;a href="Valentino%20Rossi"&gt;Rossi&lt;/a&gt; labuh di lap ka 5. &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt; nganggeuskeun balapan posisi ka 3 nu aman sarta jadi Juara Dunya. Manéhna meunang dua kali balapan sarta dalapan kali podium lainna. &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di posisi kalima kalayan dua kali meunang balapan sarta lima kali podium lainna.
Pikeun taun 2007, Honda nyieun mesin V4 pikeun mesin &lt;a href="Honda%20RC212V"&gt;RC212V&lt;/a&gt; anyar nu siap tarung di seri &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt; 800cc. Kacepatan di trék lempeng ngurangan 15kpj. Téknologi gilinding ogé ngaronjat, sarta sistim kontrol traksi ti jaman 990c beuki disampurnakeun. Hasilna, sacara kasaluruhan kalayan motor 800cc teu béda jauh jeung 990cc.
Pikeun taun &lt;a href="2007%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt; réngréngan tim angger. Tim ngagunakeun motor &lt;a href="Honda%20RC212V"&gt;Honda RC212V&lt;/a&gt; anyar 800cc. Motor anyar ieu teu ngalantarankeun kasuksésan nu dipikaharep tapi antukna dina usumna kamapuh motor ngaronjat. &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; meunang dua kali balapan sarta di posisi kadua usum balap ieu, &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt; ngan bisa ngatur podium sarta anggeus di posisi kadalapan sagemblengna di usum balap ieu. Pikeun taun &lt;a href="2008%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;, purah balapna angger &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt;, kalayan &lt;a href="Mike%20Leitner"&gt;Mike Leitner&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Pete%20Benson"&gt;Pete Benson&lt;/a&gt; minangka lulugu mékanik &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt;, sarta &lt;a href="Kazuhiko%20Yamano"&gt;Kazuhiko Yamano&lt;/a&gt; salaku manajer tim. Dina mangsa usum éta &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; ngaganti gilinding ku &lt;a href="Bridgestone"&gt;Bridgestone&lt;/a&gt; sarta hiji dingding ditempatkeun di antara garasi &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Hayden&lt;/a&gt; pikeun nyingkahan panalungtikan data gilinding. Dingding di antara garasi tim nu sarua mimiti dilambagakeun ku &lt;a href="Valentino%20Rossi"&gt;Rossi&lt;/a&gt; di awal usum antara manéhna jeung &lt;a href="Jorge%20Lorenzo"&gt;Jorge Lorenzo&lt;/a&gt; batur satimna di &lt;a href="Michelin"&gt;Michelin&lt;/a&gt;.
Pikeun taun &lt;a href="2009%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Andrea%20Dovizioso"&gt;Andrea Dovizioso&lt;/a&gt; nyaéta tim purah balapna.
<h3>2010an</h3>
2010an.
Pikeun taun &lt;a href="2010%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt;, diréktur Tim &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt; nyaéta &lt;a href="Kazuhiko%20Yamano"&gt;Kazuhiko Yamano&lt;/a&gt;, nalingakeun sakabéh operasi kaasup tim pabrik jeung tim satelit. &lt;a href="Toshiyuki%20Yamaji"&gt;Toshiyuki Yamaji&lt;/a&gt; ngagantikeun &lt;a href="Yamano"&gt;Yamano&lt;/a&gt; salaku Tim Manajer sarta diarahkeun sakabéh tim Repsol Honda. &lt;a href="Alberto%20Puig"&gt;Alberto Puig&lt;/a&gt; minangka Manajer Tim &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Gianni%20Berti"&gt;Gianni Berti&lt;/a&gt; minangka Manajer Tim &lt;a href="Andrea%20Dovizioso"&gt;Dovizioso&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Shinichi%20Kokubu"&gt;Shinichi Kokubu&lt;/a&gt; minangka Direktur Téhnik Grand Prix, nalingakeun genep mesin &lt;a href="Honda%20RC212V"&gt;RC212V&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt;.
Dina taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;, tim pabrik Repsol Honda nurunkeun tilu motor kalayan &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Dani Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Andrea%20Dovizioso"&gt;Andrea Dovizioso&lt;/a&gt; sarta Juara Dunia 2007, &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Casey Stoner&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Honda%20RC212V"&gt;Honda RC212V&lt;/a&gt; kabukti pohara kuat pikeun kompetisi taun ieu sarta &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Casey Stoner&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; ngahontal kajuaraan kalayan sésa dua balapan deui, sarta Honda ogé ngahontal gelar Tim sarta gelar ke-60 Konstruktor.
Pikeun taun &lt;a href="2011%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shuhei%20Nakamoto"&gt;Shuhei Nakamoto&lt;/a&gt; minangka Wawakil Présidén &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt; sarta mingpin tim Honda &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Shinichi%20Kokubu"&gt;Shinichi Kokubu&lt;/a&gt; minangka Direktur Téhnik, sarta &lt;a href="Livio%20Suppo"&gt;Livio Suppo&lt;/a&gt; minangka Komunikasi &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt; sarta Diréktur Marketing. &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Andrea%20Dovizioso"&gt;Dovizioso&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Casey Stoner&lt;/a&gt; minangka tim purah balapna. Tim ogé disponsoran ku &lt;a href="PT%20Astra%20Honda%20Motor"&gt;PT Astra Honda Motor&lt;/a&gt;, ngaliwatan mérek One Heart jeung Satu Hati (SaHaté). Pikeun taun &lt;a href="2012%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Stoner&lt;/a&gt; minangka tim puarah balap. Pikeun taun &lt;a href="2013%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2013&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; neruskeun purah balap tim dibarengan ku &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Marc Márquez&lt;/a&gt;, kalayan &lt;a href="Suppo"&gt;Suppo&lt;/a&gt; minangka Pupuhu Tim. Tim leungiteun sponsor One Heart jeung Satu Hati.
Dina taun &lt;a href="2014%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2014&lt;/a&gt;, Márquez jadi purah balap nu pangngorana nu meunang sapuluh kali balapan noron di &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt;. Tim disponsoran deui ku One Heart jeung Satu Hati. (SaHaté) Pikeun taun &lt;a href="2015%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Márquez&lt;/a&gt; angger jadi tim purah balap. &lt;a href="Red%20Bull"&gt;Red Bull&lt;/a&gt;, sponsor jangka panjang nu katempo dina hélm purah balap, jadi sponsor utama tim.
Kajuaraan Dunya &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt; taun 2016 mangrupa usum nu ngesankeun pikeun &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;Honda&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Marc Marquez&lt;/a&gt; mantan juara mintonkeun 22 Kajuaraan Dunya Konstruktor di kelas utama sarta nu panungtung dileler minangka purah balap pangngorana nu meunang tilu Kajuaraan Dunia kelas utama, nu ngalantarankeun nghontal lima gelar di sakabéh kelas dina karir &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix&lt;/a&gt;-na. Dina umur 23 taun sarta 242 poé, pembalap Repsol Honda meupeuskeun rékor ti purah balap legendaris &lt;a href="Mike%20Hailwood"&gt;Mike Hailwood&lt;/a&gt;, nu umurna 24 taun nalika manéhna meunang mahkota 500cc katilu kalina taun 1964.
Parobahan téknis penting dilakukeun dina tetekon Kejuaraan MotoGP 2016 kalayan diwanohkeun éléktronik terpadu sarta pindahna gilinding ti &lt;a href="Bridgestone"&gt;Bridgestone&lt;/a&gt; ka &lt;a href="Michelin"&gt;Michelin&lt;/a&gt; sarta perelu waktu pikeun insinyur sarta tim &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt; pikeun sagemblengna nitenan kumaha ngamangpaatkeun poténsi &lt;a href="Honda%20RC213V"&gt;RC213V&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;Honda Racing Corporation&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt;) poé Rabu (7/12/2016) ngabéwarakeun geus resmi manjangkeun kontrak sponsor kalayan pausahaan énérgi Spanyol, Repsol, di MotoGP nepi ka 2018. Kontrak Repsol jeung Honda kuduna baris béak dina panungtungan taun 2017. "Taun ieu kami ngahontal titel MotoGP ka-12 salila 22 taun gawé bareng, hiji pencapaian nu luar biasa dina sajarah Kajuaraan Dunya Balap motor Grand Prix," ceuk Manajer umum Race Operations Management Division &lt;a href="Honda%20RC211V"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tetsuhiro%20Kuwata"&gt;Tetsuhiro Kuwata&lt;/a&gt;, di ramatloka resmi &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt;. "Rekor kasebut mintonkeun hébatna gawé bareng antara Honda jeung Repsol. Salian kontrak sponsor nu hadé, kami ogé meunang kauntungan ti pamekaran teknologi nu krusial," ceuk &lt;a href="Kuwata"&gt;Kuwata&lt;/a&gt;. Aya genep purah balap nu kungsi jadi juara dunya kalayan Repsol Honda nyaéta &lt;a href="Michael%20Doohan"&gt;Mick Doohan&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%201994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%201998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Alex%20Criville"&gt;Alex Criville&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%201999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Valentino%20Rossi"&gt;Valentino Rossi&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grrand%20Prix%20usum%202001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%202003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Nicky Hayden&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%202006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Casey Stoner&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%202011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;), sarta &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Marc Marquez&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%202013"&gt;2013&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20prix%20usum%202014"&gt;2014&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%202016"&gt;2016&lt;/a&gt;).
Juara Dunya &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Marc Marquez&lt;/a&gt; jeung batur satimna &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Dani Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; neruskeun pangujian tilu poé maranémhna di Sirkuit Internasional Sepang kalayan ngalakonan lalampahan ka Indonésia pikeun medalkeun kelir Tim Repsol Honda &lt;a href="2017"&gt;2017&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt; International Expo (JIExpo) di ibukota nagara.
